  "question": {
    "text": "In a series LCR circuit, a resistor of $300 \\Omega$, a capacitor of 25 nF and an inductor of 100 mH are used. For maximum current in the circuit, the angular frequency of the ac source is _____ $\\times 10^4$ radians $\\mathrm{s}^{-1}$.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\omega=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\mathrm{LC}}} \\\\ & \\omega=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25 \\times 10^{-9} \\times 100 \\times 10^{-3}}} \\\\ & \\omega=\\frac{10^{+6}}{5 \\times 10}=2\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
